From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: voidforge <voidforge@valuz.io>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:11:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] openarc: embedder: history and password import from other
 browsers

Plan D3b. OACImport.h: -[OACProfile importDataOfTypes:fromSource:...]
reads a Chromium-family profile folder (History; Login Data and Login
Data For Account, decrypted with the browser's Safe Storage keychain
key), Safari's History.db (needs Full Disk Access; reported, never
requested) or Safari's export files (ZIP, passwords CSV, history JSON)
from temporary copies, and writes history through //chrome's
ProfileWriter and passwords through the password manager's
PasswordImporter (duplicates skipped, conflicting saved logins kept).
---
